UNO Mini FAP PACKAGE PLACEHOLDER
===============================

This repository environment cannot compile a real Flipper Zero binary `.fap`
(no `fbt` toolchain and no network access to install it).

Use this source file to build the real app binary on a Flipper firmware tree:
- Source: flipper_apps/uno_fap_all_in_one.c
- Entry point: uno_app

Manifest block is embedded at the top of the source file.

Build command on a proper Flipper SDK/firmware setup:
  ./fbt fap_uno_fap

Expected binary output:
  build/f7-firmware-D/.extapps/Games/uno_fap.fap
